For the question "Implement a function to find the median of two sorted arrays of different sizes with O(1) space complexity and O(n) time complexity.", which response is of higher quality? Reply with A or B.
A: ```
def median(arr1, arr2):
    if len(arr1) > len(arr2):
        arr1, arr2 = arr2, arr1
    low = 0
    high = len(arr1) - 1

    while low < high:
        if arr1[low] > arr2[high]:
            arr1, arr2 = arr2, arr1
            low, high = low + 1, high - 1
        elif arr1[low] == arr2[high]:
            low += 1
            high -= 1

    return arr1[low]
```
